  "summary": "C14 extracts the 60x60 region from all downloaded daily files into region.npz; C18 builds +/-5-day pools per day of year (2000-calendar mapping), computes hazen 90th-percentile thresholds, smooths them with a circular 31-day mean, and compares target-period SST (2014-06-01..08-31) against the smoothed threshold at target days of year 153-244, which draws on unsmoothed thresholds for days 138-259 and hence pooled baseline values from May 12 to Sep 20 of each year; it then detects runs, joins gaps and saves res.npz, which C19 writes to output/mhw_mask.nc."
